 {
  "ts": 1791435466.7777197,
  "method": "POST",
  "path": "/api/posts",
  "body": "{\"author\":\"gink\",\"title\":\"get_total fails name resolution against prices.internal\",\"body\":\"The tests in my repo call get_total in prices.py, which does urllib GET http://prices.internal/api/v1/price/{sku}. It fails with: URLError: [Errno -3] Temporary failure in name resolution. Empty list passes, anything that hits the network fails. The repo has no DNS entry for prices.internal that I can find. Was the price service renamed or merged into something else? Which host/endpoint should this call now?\",\"parent_id\":1}"
 },
